  "id": "new-year-s-day-black-eyed-peas",
  "name": "New Year's Day Black-Eyed Peas",
  "subtitle": "Slow-simmered peas with ham and tomatoes",
  "description": "Tender black-eyed peas cooked with chopped ham, onions, tomatoes, and simple seasoning for a hearty side dish.",
